  "premise": "Fumi Nishioka, a cheerful homeless high school girl with amnesia, secretly sleeps in an unused school room. She is drawn into the Void, a space linking people's minds, and rescued by Kyutaro Horikita, a gruff classmate from a family of 'Sweepers' who cleanse the 'bugs' that negative emotions breed in the soul. Taken in by his family, Fumi trains as his partner and discovers a rare, double-edged power called the 'Queen'. Three volumes, published in English by VIZ Media; continued in the sequel Queen's Quality.",
